<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We, like Peter, all have stumbled,</l><l>Such defeats make our strength crumble,</l><l>Our once proud hearts become humble,</l><l>We are so low,</l><l>In these moments the Lord comes in,</l><l>Seeking our love and affection,</l><l>As we listen, we can hear Him</l><l>Saying to us...</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
